---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Architectural & Real Estate Photography Bristol | The Lightworks"
  description="Premium architectural and real estate photography in Bristol. Offering 2-hour focused shoots, bespoke half-day/full-day commissions, and highly efficient real estate marketing packages."
>
  <div class="page-wrapper">
    
    <!-- ==========================================
         SECTION 1: ARCHITECTURAL PHOTOGRAPHY
         ========================================== -->
         
    <!-- ARCHITECTURAL HERO -->
    <section class="subpage-hero" id="architectural">
      <div class="fullwidth-image-wrapper">
        <picture>
          <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/images/Main/Main_2000p_001.JPG" />
          <img src="/images/Main/Main_2000p_001.JPG" alt="Luxury Architectural Photography Bristol" />
        </picture>
        <div class="hero-overlay-text">
          <h1>Architectural Photography</h1>
          <p class="subtitle italic" style="color: #F9F6F0;">Editorial imagery for architects, interior designers, and property developers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ARCHITECTURAL PHILOSOPHY -->
    <section class="image-break vertical-layout" style="padding-top: 5rem;">
      <div class="content-side" style="padding-right: 2rem;">
        <h2>CAPTURING THE SPACE</h2>
        <p class="body-text">
          We work closely with architects, interior designers, and property developers to understand and highlight what makes your project unique. By collaborating with stylists on set when needed, we ensure every room is presented at its absolute best.
        </p>
        <p class="body-text">
          Using single-point perspectives, tailored focal lengths, and a careful approach to natural light, we deliver exceptional, editorial-style architectural photography. To help tell the complete story, we also offer aerial drone photography to show exactly how your architecture fits into the local landscape and interacts with its surroundings.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="image-wrapper">
        <img src="/images/Main/Main_2000p_004.JPG" alt="Interior Design Photography Bristol" />
      </div>
      <div class="full-width-divider"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- ARCHITECTURAL COMMISSIONS (RATES) -->
    <section class="commissions-section">
      <div class="text-container centered" style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
        <h2>Bespoke Commissions</h2>
        <p class="body-text" style="text-wrap: balance; max-width: 750px; margin: 1.5rem auto 0 auto;">
          We understand that capturing a unique architectural space to its full potential requires time, patience, and an unhurried approach to chasing the perfect light. Commissions start from <strong>£299</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="commissions-grid">
        <div class="commission-card">
          <h3>Focused Sessions (2 Hours)</h3>
          <p>Ideal for smaller projects, single-room renovations, or targeted updates to your portfolio. This package focuses strictly on delivering premium still photography with maximum efficiency.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="commission-card">
          <h3>Half-Day & Full-Day Rates</h3>
          <p>To ensure we deliver to the highest editorial standards, our architectural work is primarily offered via dedicated half-day and full-day commissions. This allows for meticulous styling, precise lighting adjustments, and comprehensive coverage of the project.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="commission-card">
          <h3>Videography Extension</h3>
          <p>A full-day commission provides the ideal timeframe to seamlessly weave cinematic video into your portfolio. We frequently shoot high-end videography alongside stills during these sessions. Please refer to our <a href="/videography" class="inline-link">Videography page</a> for more information.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ==========================================
         SECTION 2: REAL ESTATE PHOTOGRAPHY
         ========================================== -->
         
    <!-- REAL ESTATE HERO -->
    <section class="subpage-hero" id="real-estate" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
      <div class="fullwidth-image-wrapper">
        <picture>
          <source media="(max-width: 768px)" srcset="/images/Portfolio/Portfolio_1080p_002.JPG" />
          <img src="/images/Portfolio/Portfolio_2000p_002.JPG" alt="Premium Real Estate Photography Bristol" />
        </picture>
        <div class="hero-overlay-text">
          <h2>Premium Real Estate</h2>
          <p class="subtitle italic" style="color: #F9F6F0;">Maximizing property interest and accelerating sales.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- REAL ESTATE PHILOSOPHY (Reversed Layout for Visual Flow) -->
    <section class="image-break vertical-layout reverse-layout" style="padding-top: 5rem;">
      <div class="image-wrapper">
        <img src="/images/Portfolio/Portfolio_2000p_001.JPG" alt="Luxury Real Estate Marketing South West" />
      </div>
      <div class="content-side" style="padding-left: 2rem;">
        <h2>ELEVATING THE LISTING</h2>
        <p class="body-text">
          In the competitive property market, outstanding imagery is your strongest asset. We work directly with leading agents and homeowners to create visual marketing that commands attention, maximizing property interest and accelerating sales.
        </p>
        <p class="body-text">
          We know the industry moves fast. To respect your time and your vendors' schedules, we have engineered highly efficient on-site workflows. This allows us to deliver uncompromising, high-end media within strict commercial timeframes.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="full-width-divider"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- REAL ESTATE PACKAGES -->
    <section class="packages-layout" style="padding-top: 3rem; padding-bottom: 6rem;">
      <div class="image-break vertical-layout" style="padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0;">
        <h2 class="desktop-full-title">REAL ESTATE PACKAGES</h2>
        <div class="image-wrapper">
          <img src="/images/Portfolio/Portfolio_1080p_003.JPG" alt="Real Estate Photography Packages" style="max-height: 75vh; object-fit: cover; width: 100%;" />
        </div>
        <div class="content-side">
          <p class="body-text packages-intro" style="margin-top: 0;">
            Every property demands a tailored visual strategy. We offer flexible media packages starting from <strong>£199</strong>, providing everything you need to present a listing at its absolute best.
          </p>
          
          <div class="package-list">
            <div class="package-item">
              <h3>Essential</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Interior & exterior photography (24-hour delivery)</li>
                <li>Aerial drone photography</li>
                <li>Precise 2D floorplan</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="package-item">
              <h3>Signature</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Comprehensive photography package</li>
                <li>Aerial drone media & architectural floorplan</li>
                <li>Cinematic highlight video (gimbal & drone)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div class="package-item">
              <h3>Extended</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>The complete Signature suite</li>
                <li>Immersive 360° virtual tour</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="package-item">
              <h3>Bespoke</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Custom add-ons tailored to your requirements</li>
                <li>Cinematic wide-format videography & dynamic vertical reels</li>
                <li>Curated social media imagery</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTACT FOOTER -->
    <footer class="footer-section" id="contact">
      <div class="text-container centered">
        <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
        <p class="subtitle italic">Book an architectural commission or real estate package.</p>
        
        <div class="contact-details">
          <a href="mailto:enquiries@thelightworks.art" class="contact-email">enquiries@thelightworks.art</a>
        </div>

        <form class="luxury-form" action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="d8c351b8-59e4-4c99-9236-ecd105a16121">
          <div class="form-group">
            <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name or Agency" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email Address" required />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <textarea name="message" placeholder="Please specify if you require an Architectural Commission or Real Estate Package." rows="4" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <input type="checkbox" name="botcheck" class="hidden" style="display: none;">
          <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Send Enquiry</button>
        </form>
        
        <p class="copyright">&copy; 2026 The Lightworks. All Rights Reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Local Styles (Header CSS is handled globally by Layout.astro) */
  .page-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text-mahogany);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-mahogany);
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0 0;
  }

  .subtitle.italic {
    font-style: italic;
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .body-text {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--muted-mahogany);
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .inline-link {
    color: var(--text-mahogany);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--text-mahogany);
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .inline-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .text-container.centered {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .text-container.centered h2 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* Subpage Hero */
  .subpage-hero {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 95px;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .subpage-hero .fullwidth-image-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    height: 65vh; 
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--text-mahogany);
  }

  .subpage-hero img {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    opacity: 0.75; 
  }

  .hero-overlay-text {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    text-align: center;
    width: 90%;
    max-width: 1000px;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .hero-overlay-text h1,
  .hero-overlay-text h2 {
    color: #F9F6F0;
    font-size: 4rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  /* Split Layout */
  .image-break {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 4rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .vertical-layout {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .reverse-layout {
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
  }

  .vertical-layout .image-wrapper {
    flex: 0 0 40%;
    max-width: 40%;
  }

  .vertical-layout .image-wrapper img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .vertical-layout .content-side {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .content-side h2 {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .full-width-divider {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-mahogany);
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  /* Commissions Grid - Fixed for 3 Columns */
  .commissions-section {
    padding: 2rem 4rem 6rem 4rem;
    max-width: 1500px; /* Slightly wider to accommodate 3 columns perfectly */
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .commissions-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr) !important; /* Forces 3 equal columns */
    gap: 2.5rem; /* Reduced gap slightly to prevent text overflow on smaller laptops */
    margin-top: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .commission-card {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-mahogany);
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .commission-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .commission-card p {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--muted-mahogany);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Real Estate Packages Styles */
  .desktop-full-title {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    width: 100%;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin: 0 0 -2.5rem 0; 
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text-mahogany);
  }

  .package-list {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .package-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-mahogany);
  }

  .package-item ul {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .package-item li {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--muted-mahogany);
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .package-item li::before {
    content: "—";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-mahogany);
  }

  /* Footer / Contact */
  .footer-section {
    padding: 4rem 2rem 6rem 2rem;
    background-color: #F2EFE9;
  }

  .contact-details {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .contact-email {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--text-mahogany);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }

  .contact-email:hover {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .luxury-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    margin: 0 auto 5rem auto;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .form-group input,
  .form-group textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-mahogany);
    color: var(--text-mahogany);
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .form-group input:focus,
  .form-group textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--text-mahogany);
  }

  .submit-btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background-color: var(--text-mahogany);
    color: var(--bg-cream);
    border: none;
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }

  .submit-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .copyright {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-mahogany);
  }

  /* ==========================================
     MOBILE OPTIMIZATION
     ========================================== */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    body, html, .page-wrapper {
      overflow-x: hidden !important;
      width: 100% !important;
    }

    section, footer {
      scroll-margin-top: 115px; 
    }

    .subpage-hero {
      margin-top: 130px !important;
    }

    .subpage-hero .fullwidth-image-wrapper {
      height: 45vh !important;
    }

    .hero-overlay-text h1,
    .hero-overlay-text h2 {
      font-size: 2rem !important;
    }

    .hero-overlay-text .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.85rem !important;
      margin-top: 1rem !important;
    }

    .image-break {
      padding: 0 1rem !important;
    }

    .vertical-layout {
      display: flex !important;
      flex-direction: column !important;
      gap: 2rem !important;
      padding-top: 2.5rem !important;
    }

    .reverse-layout {
      flex-direction: column !important;
    }

    .vertical-layout .content-side {
      padding-right: 0 !important;
      padding-left: 0 !important;
    }

    .vertical-layout .content-side h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem !important;
      text-align: center !important;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
    }

    .vertical-layout .body-text {
      font-size: 0.9rem !important;
      line-height: 1.5 !important;
      margin-bottom: 1rem !important;
    }

    .vertical-layout .image-wrapper {
      width: 100% !important;
      max-width: 100% !important;
    }

    .full-width-divider {
      width: 100vw !important;
      position: relative !important;
      left: 50% !important;
      right: 50% !important;
      margin-left: -50vw !important;
      margin-right: -50vw !important;
    }

    .commissions-section {
      padding: 2rem 1rem 4rem 1rem !important;
    }

    .commissions-section .text-container.centered h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem !important;
    }

    .commissions-section .body-text {
      font-size: 0.9rem !important;
      line-height: 1.5 !important;
    }

    /* Stack cards in a single column on mobile */
    .commissions-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
      gap: 2.5rem !important;
      margin-top: 2rem !important;
    }

    .commission-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.25rem !important;
    }

    .commission-card p {
      font-size: 0.95rem !important;
    }

    .packages-layout {
      padding-top: 2rem !important;
      padding-bottom: 3rem !important;
    }

    .packages-layout .desktop-full-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem !important;
      text-align: center !important;
      margin-bottom: 1rem !important;
    }

    .package-item h3 {
      font-size: 0.85rem !important;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem !important;
    }

    .package-item li {
      font-size: 0.7rem !important;
      line-height: 1.25 !important;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem !important;
      padding-left: 0.6rem !important;
    }

    .footer-section {
      padding: 2.5rem 1rem 3rem 1rem !important; 
    }

    .footer-section .text-container.centered h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem !important;
    }

    .footer-section .text-container.centered .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.8rem !important;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem !important;
    }

    .contact-email {
      font-size: 1.25rem !important;
    }

    .luxury-form {
      gap: 1rem !important; 
      margin-bottom: 2rem !important;
    }

    .form-group input,
    .form-group textarea,
    .submit-btn {
      padding: 1rem !important; 
      font-size: 0.9rem !important; 
    }
  }
</style>